      "parameters": {
        "content": "# RSS Feed Node\nOn a schedule, checks RSS feed for new items, posts them to Discord server\n1. Scheduled trigger runs automaticaly when workflow is published\n2. RSS Read - same deal as above\n3. Ensure Table - creates PostgreSQL table if none exists\n4. Get Posted - pullls all item ID's from database for filtering\n5. Diff New Items - compares new RSS feed IDs against IDs in Postgres, returns diffs\n- Workflow stops if there are no diffs\n6. Loop over items - batches items by 1, loops through each\n7. Format Message - item values used in message template\n8. DiscordPost - REST API (POST) posts message to Discord via webhook\n9. Mark Posted - adds new item IDs to Postgres database\n10. Wait - waits 0.5s per message to avoid rate limits",
